              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi nibarangiza guhamya kwabo, inyamaswa izazamuka ivuye ikuzimu irwane na bo, ibaneshe ibīce. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.1.9+ISA.1.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 1.9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Intumbi zabo zizarambarara mu nzira nyabagendwa yo mu mudugudu munini, ari wo witwa i Sodomu no muri Egiputa mu mvugo y'umwuka, ari na ho Umwami wabo yabambwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko abo mu moko n'imiryango n'indimi n'amahanga, bazamara iminsi itatu n'igice bareba intumbi zabo, ntibazazikundira guhambwa mu mva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abari mu isi bazazīshima hejuru bazikina ku mubyimba banezerwe, bohererezanye impano kuko abo bahanuzi bombi bababazaga abari mu isi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
