          "text": " Marayika wa karindwi avuza impanda. Mu ijuru havuga amajwi arenga ngo “Ubwami bw'isi bubaye ubw'Umwami wacu n'ubwa Kristo we, kandi azahora ku ngoma iteka ryose.”",
